 "remarks": "Why rent when you can own? This unit has wonderful views overlooking the pool with a private deck. Winnipauk Village features beautiful grounds, 2 pools, a kiddie pool, clubhouse, gym and pickleball courts. Winnipauk Village is a pet friendly complex. Bring your imagination and make this wonderful 1 bedroom, 1 bath unit your own, the bones are great. There is a walk-in-closet in the bedroom and the washer/dryer is located within the unit. HOA fee breakdown is $156 for general HOA (water & sewer is included) and $105 for the SSD (special services district) making a total HOA monthly fee of $261. One reserved parking space and plenty of unreserved spaces. This complex was recently paved, new fiberoptic was installed, new siding, roof and decks. The HVAC was replaced in 2019, hot water heater in 2023, sliders and window in 2012 and a new bathroom tile floor. The special assessment is paid off. 234 Units, roughly 29 are reported as investor owned. The owner must live there for 1 year before renting. Schedule your private showing today in this very well managed association. Professional photos coming Thursday.",
